OL,3,AHelen Jenner likely to take over as
OL,4,AReform Wales leader, sources tell BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform is likely to appoint Helen
OL,7,FJenner to take over from Dan Thomas as
OL,8,Fthe party's Welsh leader, sources have
OL,9,Ftold BBC Wales.
OL,11,FIt is understood she is the favourite
OL,12,Fto replace Thomas, who quit following
OL,13,Fan arrest on suspicion of assault, and
OL,14,Fthat "very senior" Reform figures had
OL,15,Fbacked her.
OL,17,FJenner, an MS for Bangor Conwy Mon, is
OL,18,Fthe party's interim Welsh leader and
OL,19,Fwas Thomas' deputy.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
